      "cooked": "<p>If you’ve not been reading the comic book series Irredeemable look away from this thread now, I expect it to contain spoilers later. If you haven’t been reading it, why not?</p>\n<p><em>CLAP</em> <em>CLAP</em> <em>CLAP</em></p>\n<p>Well done Mr Waid, that is an excellent ending to the series, one of the best tie ins I have seen and completely unexpected despite being well telegraphed from the beginning by all the promotional material.</p>\n<p>I look forward to seeing how Incorruptible ends too (IMO the better of the two series)</p>",
