      "cooked": "<p>I’ve been reading Iredeemable on Comixology but have only gotten up to issue <span class=\"hashtag\">#35</span>.  I can see that they have <span class=\"hashtag\">#36</span> and <span class=\"hashtag\">#37</span> (the final one) available, but <span class=\"hashtag\">#37</span> is $3.99.  I’ll be damned if I’m going to pay $4 for an electronic comic.</p>",
